# Security

Read @docs/SECURITY.md.

- RLS on every exposed table. Authenticated ≠ authorized.
- Staff roles live in `admin_roles`. Never trust `user_metadata` for authorization.
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` is server-only. Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` secrets.
- Guest carts: httpOnly `session_id` + Server Actions. Do not let the client query carts by arbitrary session id.
- Guest quotes: unguessable token or matching email. Do not list all quotes to any user.
- Private documents: Supabase Storage + short-lived signed URLs after authz. Cloudinary is public product media only.
- Paystack: verify signature; persist `provider_event_id`; idempotent handler; verify amount/reference.
- Admin `/admin/**`: session + `admin_roles` on the server. SALES cannot change system settings. WAREHOUSE cannot edit prices.
